hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4","(3) Pakhana, peshab aur neend se wuzu ka bab. Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne hamein khabar di, Asim se, Zirr se unhon ne kaha: Main Safwan ibn Assal al-Muradi Raziallahu anhu ke paas aaya to unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) hamein hukm dete the jab hum safar me ya musafir hote ke apne khuff teen din aur un ki raatein na utarein magar janabat ki wajah se, aur pakhane ki wajah se na utarein, na peshab ki wajah se, na neend ki wajah se."
